graph"> INSURED </span>does not reimburse the<span class="normalBoldParagraph"> COMPANY </span>or counsel appointed by the<span class="normalBoldParagraph"> COMPANY </span>within sixty (60) days, the<span class="normalBoldParagraph"> COMPANY </span>will be entitled to recover from the<span class="normalBoldParagraph"> INSURED </span>reasonable legal fees, costs, and expenses incurred by the<span class="normalBoldParagraph"> COMPANY </span>in collecting the<span class="normalBoldParagraph"> DEDUCTIBLE. </span>
